function updateStatus(e,t){updateStatusHelper(e,t).then((function(e){refreshOrderRow(e);setDefaultOption("action")})).catch((function(e){showErrorToast2("Không thể tải thông tin đơn hàng: "+e.responseText,"none")}))}function refreshOrderRow(e){const t=document.querySelector("#infoTable tbody");const n=t.querySelectorAll("tr");var r=e.script;var o=e.order;$("#aorder-response").html(r);if(o.id===0)return;for(let r=0;r<n.length;r++){if(n[r].id==="order"+o.id){const s=n[r];const a=s.querySelector(".current-status");a.innerText=e.statusName;if(a.classList.contains(`status-${o.status-1}`)){a.classList.remove(`status-${o.status-1}`)}a.classList.add(`status-${o.status}`);s.querySelector(".updateTime").innerText=e.updateAt;const c=s.querySelector(".btn-next-status");c.innerText=e.nextStatusName;if(c.classList.contains(`btn-status-${o.status}`)){c.classList.remove(`btn-status-${o.status}`)}c.classList.add(`btn-status-${e.nextStatus}`);c.setAttribute("onclick",`updateStatus('${o.id}','${e.nextStatus}')`);t.insertBefore(s,n[0]);setDefaultOption("action");break}}}function updateStatusHelper(e,t){return new Promise(((n,r)=>{$.ajax({url:"aorder?a=update",type:"POST",dataType:"json",data:{id:e,status:t},success:function(e){console.log(e);n(e)},error:function(e){r(e)}})}))}function handleChange(e){e.stopPropagation();let t=e.target.value;console.log("selected value: "+t);const n=e.currentTarget.closest(".group");t=t.toUpperCase();var r=parseInt(n.querySelector(".id").innerText);switch(t){case"3":{console.log("const");updateStatus(r,t);break}default:updateStatus(r,t)}}function setDefaultOption(e){document.querySelectorAll("select[name="+e+"]").forEach((e=>{const t=e.getAttribute("data-default");e.value=t}))}function query(e){e.preventDefault();const t=document.querySelector("select#byStatus").value;const n=e.currentTarget;n.href=n.href+"&status="+t;window.location.href=n.href}function queryBy(e){var t=e.currentTarget.value;window.location.href="aorder?a=query&page=1&status="+t;console.log(t)}function showDetail(e,t){e.preventDefault();e.stopPropagation();getDetail(t).then((function(e){renderDetail(e)})).catch((function(e){showErrorToast2("Không thể tải chi tiết đơn hàng.","none")}))}function getDetail(e){return new Promise(((t,n)=>{$.ajax({url:"aorder?a=detail&id="+e,type:"POST",dataType:"json",success:function(e){console.log(e);t(e)},error:function(e){n(e)}})}))}function renderDetail(e){const t=document.querySelector("#detail-modal");t.classList.add("active");var n=e.order;t.querySelector(".id").innerText=n.id;t.querySelector(".createAt").innerText=e.createAt;t.querySelector(".receiverInfo").innerText=n.receiverInfo;t.querySelector(".product-list").innerText=e.productList;t.querySelector(".paymentInfo").innerText=e.paymentInfo;t.querySelector(".shippingFee").innerText=e.shippingFee;t.querySelector(".discountVoucher").innerText=e.discountVoucher;t.querySelector(".totalMoney").innerText=e.totalMoney;if(n.isPayed===1)t.querySelector(".total-money-container").classList.add("no-print")}function printDetail(){const e=document.querySelector("#detail-modal");const t=e.querySelectorAll(".no-print-sure");t.forEach((e=>{e.style.display="none"}));var n=e.innerHTML;var r="";var o=document.styleSheets;for(var s=0;s<o.length;s++){try{if(o[s].cssRules){for(var a=0;a<o[s].cssRules.length;a++){r+=o[s].cssRules[a].cssText}}}catch(e){console.log(e)}}var c=window.open("","","height=600,width=800");c.document.write("<html><head><title>Print Modal</title>");c.document.write("<style>"+r+"</style>");c.document.write("</head><body>");c.document.write(n);c.document.write("</body></html>");c.document.close();c.print();c.close();t.forEach((e=>{e.style.display="flex"}))}function printBase(){const e=document.querySelector("#detail-modal");const t=e.querySelectorAll(".no-print");t.forEach((e=>{e.style.display="none"}));var n=document.querySelector("#detail-modal").innerHTML;var r="";var o=document.styleSheets;for(var s=0;s<o.length;s++){try{if(o[s].cssRules){for(var a=0;a<o[s].cssRules.length;a++){r+=o[s].cssRules[a].cssText}}}catch(e){console.log(e)}}var c=window.open("","","height=600,width=800");c.document.write("<html><head><title>Print Modal</title>");c.document.write("<style>"+r+"</style>");c.document.write("</head><body>");c.document.write(n);c.document.write("</body></html>");c.document.close();c.print();c.close();t.forEach((e=>{e.style.display="flex"}))}function setTitle(e){document.querySelector(".pagetitle h1").innerText=e}